rtical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">End to End support: Our 24/7 supportive team provides assistance from the day of the booking to the final delivery.</span></p></li></ul><h1 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:20pt;margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Customer satisfaction is our priority&nbsp;</span></h1><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">At Anant Logistic Packers and Movers, all we do is customer centric. We take time to understand the requirements of customers and provide the customer services for each shifting process.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The customized service always fits your budget. We have a record of growing repeated clients.</span></p><p><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\"><br></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Cities We Serve</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We have an extensive network across major cities like Delhi, Mumbai, Kolkata, Chennai Hyderabad, Bangalore, Pune, Ahmedabad etc.</span></p><p><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\"><br></b></p><h1 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:20pt;margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">How to book with Anant logistic Packers and Movers&nbsp;</span></h1><ol style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Request a free quote: You can call us or visit our website</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Schedule a pre move survey: We access your volume of goods and moving requirement</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Get a customised plan: Transparent Pricing with customized moving plan</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Pack, Move and Deliver: Sit back while we handle all the movement process</span></p></li></ol><p><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\"><br></b></p><h1 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:20pt;margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Conclusion&nbsp;</span></h1><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Whether you have a small apartment or a large corporate office for shifting the team at Anant logistic Packers and Movers is your best partner. Being the top rated Movers and Packers in the city you don\'t just move dudes but we bring your old memories and emotions to your new location by putting your goods at the specified places. Don\'t wait, just call us or visit our website for a smart and seamless experience!</span></p><p><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\"><br></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact us today for a free estimate&nbsp;</span></p><p></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Phone: </span><a href=\"tel: +919355133755\" alt=\"Call\" style=\"outline: none; color: rgb(21, 106, 181); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); --bs-link-color-rgb: 10,88,202; font-family: Jost, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal;\">+91 93-5513-3755</a></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline;\">Website:<a href=\"&nbsp;https://anantlogistic.com\">&nbsp;</a></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 14.6667px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><b><a href=\"&nbsp;https://anantlogistic.com\">https://anantlogistic.com</a></b></font></span></p></li></ul>', '14/06/2025', 'Anant Logistic Packers and Movers, trusted relocation partner, professional packers movers India, insured moving services, IBA certified movers, stress-free relocation, home shifting services, office relocation experts, vehicle transport India, pet r', '801749881699.png', 0, '2025-06-17 17:04:49');
INSERT INTO `blog` (`b_id`, `category`, `author`, `title`, `url`, `description`, `time`, `blogDetails`, `date`, `tags`, `image`, `status`, `timestamp`) VALUES
(6, '3', 'Anant Logistic', 'Car Transport Tips to Avoid Damage During Transportation', 'car-transport-tips-to-avoid-damage-during-transportation', 'Discover essential car transport tips to avoid damage during relocation. Learn how to prepare your vehicle, choose the right carrier, and ensure a smooth transportation process.', '11:15 AM', '<h2><b><span style=\"color:windowtext\">How to Keep Your Car Safe During\r\nTransport: Expert Tips<o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Shipping your car doesn’t have to be a nerve-wracking\r\nexperience. With the right precautions, you can avoid dings, scratches, and\r\nother headaches. At Anant Logistic, we’ve helped thousands of customers move\r\ntheir vehicles safely—here’s what we’ve learned works best.</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span class=\"MsoBookTitle\">1. Pick Your Transport Company\r\nLike You’d Pick a Mechanic<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl3 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Not all carriers are created equal. A good rule\r\nof thumb? Look for:</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl3 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Proper credentials: DOT/FMCSA licensing isn’t\r\njust paperwork—it’s your guarantee they follow safety rules.</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl3 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Real customer stories: Skip the flashy ads and\r\ndig into reviews. A pattern of on-time deliveries beats a slick website any\r\nday.</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl3 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->No surprise fees: If a quote seems too good to\r\nbe true, it probably is. Reputable companies explain costs upfront.</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span class=\"MsoBookTitle\">2. Insurance Isn’t Just a\r\nCheckbox<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl2 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->That fine print matters more than you think:</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl2 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Basic coverage often excludes minor damage\r\n(think rock chips or door dings).</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl2 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->For classic or luxury cars, ask about\r\nsupplemental policies—your regular auto insurance might not cover transport\r\nmishaps.</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span class=\"MsoBookTitle\">3. Be Your Car’s Best Witness<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl1 level1 lfo3\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Smartphone cameras are your best friend here:</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl1 level1 lfo3\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Take timestamped photos of every angle,\r\nespecially existing imperfections.</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl1 level1 lfo3\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Walk around the car with the driver during\r\npickup and note any issues on their inspection form.</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span class=\"MsoBookTitle\">4. Prep Work That Actually Makes\r\na Difference<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl0 level1 lfo4\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Little things prevent big problems:</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl0 level1 lfo4\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Empty it out: That gym bag in the trunk? Most\r\ncarriers won’t cover stolen personal items.</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl0 level1 lfo4\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Battery check: A dead battery upon arrival ruins\r\nthe homecoming. Disconnect it if shipping long-distance.</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl0 level1 lfo4\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Less gas = safer: A near-empty tank reduces fire\r\nrisk and makes the carrier’s job easier.</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span class=\"MsoBookTitle\">5. When to Splurge on Enclosed\r\nShipping<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl4 level1 lfo5\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Open trailers work fine for most daily drivers,\r\nbut consider enclosed transport if:</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl4 level1 lfo5\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->You’re moving a show car or vintage vehicle</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl4 level1 lfo5\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Your route has extreme weather (hello, mountain\r\nhailstorms!)</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl4 level1 lfo5\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->The car sits unusually low or has custom\r\nbodywork</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl4 level1 lfo5\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->At Delivery: Don’t Rush the Inspection<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl4 level1 lfo5\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->That excitement to reunite with your car?\r\nChannel it into a careful check:</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:\r\nl4 level1 lfo5\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Compare the condition to your pre-ship photos in\r\ndaylight.</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">If something’s off, note it on the delivery receipt\r\nbefore signing. Delayed claims rarely succeed.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoSubtitle\"><span style=\"color:windowtext\">Why This All Matters<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">A damaged car isn’t just about repair bills—it’s wasted\r\ntime and frustration. Following these steps gives you peace of mind and keeps\r\nyour vehicle in showroom condition.</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Pro Tip: Schedule shipments for weekdays when dispatch\r\nteams are fully staffed to handle issues quickly.</p><p class=\"MsoSubtitle\"><span style=\"color:windowtext\">Need a Stress-Free Move?<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Anant Logistic’s team handles each car like it’s our own.\r\nGet your no-hassle quote today or call us to chat about\r\nyour&nbsp;specific&nbsp;needs.<o:p></o:p></p>', '29/07/2025', 'Car transport tips, Avoid car damage, Vehicle relocation, Car shipping guide, Car transport safety, Car moving tips, Safe car transportation, Prepare car for shipping', '821753768432.jpg', 0, '2025-07-29 05:53:52'),
(8, '0', 'Anant Logistic', 'Packers and Movers Delhi Price List  What to Expect with Anant Logistic', 'packers-and-movers-delhi-price-list--what-to-expect-with-anant-logistic', 'If you’ve ever planned a move in Delhi, you know one of the first (and most confusing) questions is:\n Before you book, here’s what packers and movers in Delhi typically charge?', '15:00', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\">If you’ve ever planned a move in Delhi, you know one of the\nfiRs t (and most confusing) questions is:<br>\n<b>Before you book, here’s what packeRs &nbsp;and moveRs &nbsp;in Delhi typically chargeRs </b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You’ll likely come across a wide range of estimates—and half\nthe time, no one tells you what’s <i>included</i> in that price. At <b>Anant\nLogistic</b>, we believe in <b>clarity and fairness</b> when it comes to\nrelocation pricing.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">So in this blog, we’re breaking it all down for you: real\nrates, what affects the cost, and how to make sure you’re getting the best\nvalue for your move in Delhi.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Delhi PackeRs &nbsp;and\nMoveRs &nbsp;Price List – Quick Overview</b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Here is a difficult estimate of <a href=\"https://anantlogistic.com/delhi/packers-movers-delhi\"><b>packeRs &nbsp;and moves in Delhi</b></a> based on the extent\nof your house and the current distance. This includes packaging, loading,\ntransport and unloading.<o:p></o:p></p><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:30.0pt\">\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:solid black .75pt;\n  padding:1.0pt 1.0pt 1.0pt 1.0pt;height:30.0pt\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Type of Move</b><o:p></o:p></p>\n  </td>\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid black 1.0pt;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:\n  