rmal\">Car Transport<o:p></o:p></p>\n  </td>\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;\n  border-right:solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid black .75pt;\n  mso-border-left-alt:solid black .75pt;mso-border-alt:solid black .75pt;\n  padding:1.0pt 1.0pt 1.0pt 1.0pt;height:16.5pt\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">–<o:p></o:p></p>\n  </td>\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;\n  border-right:solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid black .75pt;\n  mso-border-left-alt:solid black .75pt;mso-border-alt:solid black .75pt;\n  padding:1.0pt 1.0pt 1.0pt 1.0pt;height:16.5pt\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Rs 10,000 – Rs 35,000<o:p></o:p></p>\n  </td>\n </tr>\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:7;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:16.5pt\">\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border:solid black 1.0pt;border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:\n  solid black .75pt;mso-border-alt:solid black .75pt;padding:1.0pt 1.0pt 1.0pt 1.0pt;\n  height:16.5pt\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Bike Transport<o:p></o:p></p>\n  </td>\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;\n  border-right:solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid black .75pt;\n  mso-border-left-alt:solid black .75pt;mso-border-alt:solid black .75pt;\n  padding:1.0pt 1.0pt 1.0pt 1.0pt;height:16.5pt\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">–<o:p></o:p></p>\n  </td>\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;\n  border-right:solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid black .75pt;\n  mso-border-left-alt:solid black .75pt;mso-border-alt:solid black .75pt;\n  padding:1.0pt 1.0pt 1.0pt 1.0pt;height:16.5pt\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Rs 2,999 – Rs 12,000<o:p></o:p></p>\n  </td>\n </tr>\n</tbody></table><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i>Note</i>: Prices may vary depending on goods, floor\nlevels, packaging materials and volume of specific requirements. Always get a\npeRs onal quotation.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>What Affects PackeRs &nbsp;and MoveRs &nbsp;Charges in DelhiRs </b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>1. Volume of Household Goods</b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">More stuff&nbsp; mean more labor, packaging, and a bigger\ntruck. For example, shifting a 3BHK is obviously going to cost more than a\n1BHK.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">At <b>Anant Logistic</b>, we offer a <b>free pre-move survey</b>\n(virtual or physical) to assess your belongings and offer the most accurate\nquote.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>2. Distance Travelled</b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Local moves are less expensive than intercity moves. For\ninstance, moving from <b>Dwarka to Noida</b> may cost around Rs 5,000–Rs 8,000,\nwhile Delhi to Jaipur could go up to Rs 20,000 or more, depending on volume.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>3. Packing Quality</b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">The cost of basic packing is low, but if you have delicate\nor high-value items, it is worth investing in premium packing materials such as\nbubble rap, foam and waterproof cover.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Anant Logistic constantly makes use of super,\ndamage-resistant packaging to keep your goods safe.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>4. Floor Number and Lift Availability</b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">No liftRs &nbsp;Narrow\nstaircasesRs &nbsp;Long carriesRs &nbsp;These affect labor effort and time, which may\nslightly increase the cost. But with Anant Logistic, we always <b>disclose\nthese factoRs &nbsp;upfront</b> so there are\nno surprises on moving day.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>5. Type of Transport Vehicle</b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Shared trucks are less expensive however take longer.\nDedicated vehicles offer faster, safer shipping however fee more. We help you\nchoose the right truck depending for your timeline and budget.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>What’s Included in Anant Logistic’s PriceRs </b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">When you book with US, our standard quote coveRs :<o:p></o:p></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Door-to-door\n     service<o:p></o:p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Packing\n     and unpacking<o:p></o:p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Loading\n     and unloading<o:p></o:p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Safe\n     transport in well-maintained trucks<o:p></o:p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Trained\n     professionals handling your goods<o:p></o:p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Transparent\n     pricing (No hidden charges!)<o:p></o:p></li>\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\">We also provide extra services like insurance, storage, and\ncar/bike transport.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Car &amp; Bike Transport Charges from Delhi</b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">If you\'re relocating your home or just want to ship your\nvehicle. Anant logistic is here for you.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Car Transport Charges from Delhi:</b><o:p></o:p></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"https://anantlogistic.com/car-transport-from-delhi-to-mumbai\"><b>Delhi\n     to Mumbai (Maharashtra)</b></a>: Rs 9000 – Rs 20000<o:p></o:p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"https://anantlogistic.com/car-transport-from-delhi-to-bangalore\"><b>Delhi\n     to Bangalore (Karnataka)</b></a>: Rs 11000 – Rs 25,000<o:p></o:p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"https://anantlogistic.com/car-transport-from-delhi-to-kolkata\"><b>Delhi\n     to Kolkata (West Bengal)</b></a> : Rs 17,000 – Rs 28,000<o:p></o:p></li>\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Bike Transport Charges from Delhi:</b><o:p></o:p></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Delhi\n     to Jaipur (Rajasthan): Rs 2,500 – Rs 3,500<o:p></o:p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Delhi\n     to Pune (Maharashtra): Rs 5,000 – Rs 8,000<o:p></o:p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Delhi\n     to Chennai (Tamilnadu): Rs 7,000 – Rs 9,000<o:p></o:p></li>\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\">All caRs &nbsp;are\ntransported through enclosed bins or open provideRs &nbsp;relying in your finances and desire.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Keep Your Moving Bill Under Control</b><o:p></o:p></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Book\n     in advance:</b> Last-minute bookings regularly cost greater.<o:p></o:p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>DE\n     clutter:</b> Move simplest what you need—fewer items imply much less\n     price.<o:p></o:p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Choose\n     weekdays:</b> Weekends and month-end dates are top season.<o:p></o:p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Compare\n     quotes:</b> But always check what is blanketed before determining.<o:p></o:p></li>\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Get a Free Quote from Anant Logistic</b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">At Anant Logistic, we accept as true with transferring\nshouldn’t be annoying—or overpriced. Whether you are moving across Delhi or\nshifting to another metropolis, we promise reliable provider, educated body of\nworkeRs , and no hidden costs.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Here’s how to get started:</b><o:p></o:p></p><ol style=\"margin-top:0cm\" start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Call\n     or WhatsApp us with your moving details<o:p></o:p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Schedule\n     a free pre-move survey<o:p></o:p></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Get\n     a transparent, itemized quote<o:p></o:p></li>\n</ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\">4.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Confirm your booking and loosen\nup—we’ll cope with the relaxation!<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Final Thoughts</b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Finding a truthful and reliable packeRs &nbsp;and moveRs &nbsp;rate list in Delhi may be confusing—however it\ndoesn’t must be. With <a href=\"https://anantlogistic.com/\"><b>Anant Logistic</b></a>,\nyou get upfront pricing, skilled staff, and a smooth relocation revel in\ntailored on your needs.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">If it’s a 1BHK in Laxmi Nagar, a 3BHK in South Delhi, or an\nworkplace in Connaught Place, we’re prepared to transport you—quickly,\ncompetently, and cheaply.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Ready to moveRs <br>\n</b>Get your <b>free quote</b> from Anant Logistic today. Because your peace of\nmind is worth more than hidden charges and guesswork.<o:p></o:p></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>', '12/08/2025', 'movers and packers in Delhi, Movers Packers Delhi, Movers near me Delhi, Packers and movers in Delhi, Moving companies near me Delhi, Movers Delhi, Packers and movers near me Delhi', '481754997186.png', 0, '2025-08-14 06:03:31');
